@SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### Buscar habitaciones
GET {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/search?district=Lima&guests=2&minPrice=50&maxPrice=250&minArea=10&bedType=OnePlaza
Accept: application/json

### Obtener catálogo del layout
GET {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/layout/catalog
Accept: application/json

### Previsualizar layout
POST {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/layout/preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "widthM": 4,
  "lengthM": 5,
  "heightM": 2.8,
  "floor": "Wood",
  "wallColor": "#F3E9D7",
  "beds": [
    { "type": "OnePlaza", "x": 2, "z": 1.5, "rotationDeg": 0 }
  ],
  "windows": [
    { "wall": "N", "offset": 1, "width": 1.2 }
  ],
  "door": { "wall": "S", "offset": 0.5, "width": 0.9 }
}

### Guardar layout
PUT {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/102/layout
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "widthM": 4,
  "lengthM": 5,
  "heightM": 2.8,
  "floor": "Wood",
  "wallColor": "#F3E9D7",
  "beds": [
    { "type": "OnePlaza", "x": 2, "z": 1.5, "rotationDeg": 0 }
  ],
  "windows": [
    { "wall": "N", "offset": 1, "width": 1.2 }
  ],
  "door": { "wall": "S", "offset": 0.5, "width": 0.9 }
}

### Obtener VR scene manifest
GET {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/102/vr
Accept: application/json

### Obtener layout guardado
GET {{SmartStay.Accommodations_HostAddress}}/api/v1/rooms/102/layout
Accept: application/json

###
